          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='100260' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98463' x='805' y='521'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='18'>Scope and definitions:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='15'>Scope: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Cancelled orders are only included in the Total order graph and excluded from all other views</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='15'>Definitions:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Activated Restaurant:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Restaurant who placed an order on at least 2 seperate days, irrespective of the number of orders placed on the 1st order day. The activation week occurs on the week that the 2nd order day falls in.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Number of Active orders:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Orders placed by activated restaurants</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Suppliers per active restaurants:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Total number of suppliers that active restaurants ordered from.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Total number of supplier-users receiving orders:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Total number of supplier and restaurant combinations that received orders</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>First Order Restaurant:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Restaurant who placed an order for the first time in the evaluation week and was not activated yet in that week. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
